      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Howes_Cave%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A typical tour drops 156 feet below ground, walks 1.25 miles, climbs 139 stairs, and ends with a 0.25‑mile boat ride.",
